{
  "environment": {
    "id": "harmon-creek-hospital",
    "version": "3.0.0-hard",
    "specVersion": "1.0",
    "description": "Harmon Creek Regional Hospital — HARDENED variant (Phase H, audit finding F3). Same domain and tools as the standard pack, but: admit success drops to 0.7, supplies deplete continuously, incidents penalize -2 each, and a HIDDEN budget cycle (visibility: hidden, drains 1.5/step, resets at 0, ~67-step period) silently toggles an incident storm (p=0.5/step in the low-budget regime). The occupancy-keyed tabular agent cannot observe the regime, so the value of hovering is non-stationary — cognitive difficulty by construction, not by parameter count. Difficulty certificate: the validation curve is non-stationary across the standard budget (see difficulty-certificate.json)."
  },
